  must be broadcastable).  For example, if :attr:`input` is a
  :math:`(j \times 1 \times n \times n)` tensor and :attr:`other` is a :math:`(k \times n \times n)`
  tensor, :attr:`out` will be a :math:`(j \times k \times n \times n)` tensor.

